"testvsw" COMMENTS
================

******************* Step to run this test *******************************

1. make -f makefile.man all

2. <testname>.sh 
Note: When running the script, the users will be asked to prepare 3 tapes and
      to load the first one.  Then the users will need to hit the return.  The 
      script will then perform "ms" (making the scrap tapes) and unload all the
      tapes.  This will take about 1.5 minutes.  Afterward, the users will be
      asked to reinsert those tapes in the same order and to load the first 
      tape.  Then the users will need to hit the return again.  Finally, the
      test is ready to run (to write data into the tapes).


      THE TEST TAKES ~3 MINUTES TO RUN




